msgid "What&#8217;s A2A?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We are pleased to announce the release of A2A Java SDK 1.0.0.Alpha2. This "
"release brings significant new features and improvements as we continue to "
"align with the https://a2a-protocol.org/latest/specification/[A2A 1.0 "
"specification]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Agent2Agent (A2A) Protocol is an open standard that enables AI agents to "
"communicate and collaborate with one another, regardless of each agent's "
"underlying framework, language, or vendor. The A2A Java SDK makes it easy to "
"build A2A-compliant agents in Java, with reference implementations based on "
"Quarkus."
msgstr ""

msgid "Key Highlights in 1.0.0.Alpha2"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This release includes several important enhancements and breaking changes:"
msgstr ""

msgid "New Features"
msgstr ""

msgid "Telemetry Support"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The A2A Java SDK now includes built-in support for telemetry using "
"OpenTelemetry. This allows you to monitor and trace your agent's operations, "
"making it easier to diagnose issues and understand performance "
"characteristics."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To use the telemetry features, add the OpenTelemetry extras to your project:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Push Notifications"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We've implemented full support for push notifications as specified in the "
"A2A 1.0 specification. This allows agents to receive notifications about "
"task updates without polling."
msgstr ""

msgid "Server agents can now:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Configure push notification endpoints"
msgstr ""

msgid "Manage push notification configurations per task"
msgstr ""

msgid "Receive notifications when task states change"
msgstr ""

msgid "Clients can:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Get, set, list, and delete push notification configurations"
msgstr ""

msgid "Subscribe to task updates via push notifications"
msgstr ""

msgid "Protocol Updates"
msgstr ""

msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This release includes breaking changes to align with the latest A2A "
"specification."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**AgentEmitter API**: The `AgentExecutor` methods now use `AgentEmitter` "
"instead of the previous `EventQueue` + `TaskUpdater` combination, providing "
"a more streamlined and intuitive API. This enhancement allows sending "
"Messages for simple Agent interactions directly through the `AgentEmitter`, "
"eliminating the need to interact with the EventQueue directly."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Protocol Alignment**: Updated the A2A protocol implementation to align "
"with the latest specification revision, including updates to the gRPC "
"protocol definitions."
msgstr ""

msgid "Additional Improvements"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Null-Safety**: Migrated the spec module to use JSpecify annotations for "
"better null-safety guarantees"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Jakarta CDI Compatibility**: Added no-args constructors for improved "
"Jakarta CDI compatibility"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**HTTP+JSON/REST Transport**: Replaced `quarkus-rest-jackson` with `quarkus-"
"rest` for better integration"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Event Processing**: Implemented the MainEventBus architecture for more "
"robust event queue processing"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**MicroProfile Config**: Added missing `META-INF/beans.xml` to the "
"microprofile-config integration"
msgstr ""

